  "posted_text": "🧾 Taxation\nNJ S4390 — End Data Center Tax Credits Act\n\nThis bill allocates funds from existing tax credits to support specific New Jersey economic development programs. Specifically, it designates $250 million for projects under the ‘Next New Jersey Program Act’ and $500 million for the ‘Next New Jersey Manufacturing Program Act’ and ‘Cultural Arts Incentives Program Act,’ all managed by the New Jersey Housing and Mortgage Finance Agency. ...\n...",
